&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work weekends (available shifts include Tuesday-Saturday or Sunday-Thursday)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires bilingual proficiency: English and Japanese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be able to support customers in both English and Japanese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
