&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo’s mission is helping businesses grow by owning their data and experiences. The Director of Product, Channel Infrastructure and Mobile will lead shared infrastructure for all channels, with deep ownership of email, push, and in-app messaging. This leader will advance robust, global infrastructure and manage the full product lifecycle, focusing on mobile ecosystems (iOS, Android, and SDKs). You will own the strategic roadmap and collaborate across engineering, design, and marketing to deliver impactful customer solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence how top brands communicate at scale within a fast-growing company. You will work with industry leaders to foster a culture of innovation and excellence aligned with Klaviyo’s values. This unique opportunity places you at the helm of a transforming omnichannel platform. Your contributions will shape global business interactions and leave a lasting mark on Klaviyo’s growth journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, develop, and execute a strategic roadmap for Klaviyo&#39;s messaging platforms to enhance their scalability and performance across multiple channels. This effort will directly support our mission of customer data ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams to innovate and implement new features in mobile ecosystems, increasing our value proposition for iOS and Android. Strengthening these platforms will fortify Klaviyo&#39;s leadership in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end product lifecycle management, from ideation through delivery, ensuring product offerings meet high-quality standards and align with customer expectations. This will contribute to customer satisfaction and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish key performance metrics for the channel infrastructure and use data-driven insights to make informed decisions that propel performance improvements. This approach will foster data ownership and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with major platform partners and stakeholders to strengthen Klaviyo&#39;s market position and enhance collaborative innovation. Such partnerships are essential for maintaining our customer-first proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of talented product managers, providing mentorship and guidance to develop their skills and align their work with Klaviyo&#39;s strategic goals. Talented teams are crucial to achieving our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously assess market trends and consumer feedback to identify opportunities for new channel features or enhancements. Responding to changing dynamics will ensure competitiveness and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance communication processes to better coordinate and unify efforts across Klaviyo&#39;s global teams, ensuring the seamless integration of channel and mobile functionalities. Streamlining communication maximizes efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion an agile development approach to bring flexibility and adaptability to product development processes. This methodology supports rapid iteration and faster time-to-market for new features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate feedback loops with customers to ensure product developments resonate with end-user needs, reinforcing Klaviyo&#39;s commitment to customer-first solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement rigorous testing methodologies to ensure product reliabilities, such that each channel release is dependable and meets enterprise-grade standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for a customer-centric approach in all development initiatives, ensuring that our channels deliver personalized and impactful experiences that resonate with our clients&#39; audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3+ years of direct management experience and 10 years of experience in product management with a proven track record in scaling messaging platforms like email, SMS, RCS, WhatsApp, and mobile push notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your technical depth is exemplary, with robust understanding of iOS, Android, and mobile SDK ecosystems, enabling you to make informed strategic decisions that drive innovation and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at cross-functional leadership, effectively bringing together teams from engineering, marketing, and customer success to deliver cohesive and effective product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your data-driven mindset is impeccable, enabling you to employ analytics effectively in monitoring success metrics and iterating product strategies that enhance user experiences and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI and machine learning technologies is a plus, as these are increasingly influential in designing intuitive, predictive customer communication strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a visionary leader, capable of inspiring and mentoring teams to achieve strategic objectives while fostering a collaborative and high-performance work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your strategic acumen is backed by hands-on experience in managing end-to-end product development lifecycles, from ideation and planning through to launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-paced, dynamic environments and can deliver results in high-pressure situations, maintaining a focus on customer satisfaction and business value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your exceptional communication skills allow you to articulate complex technical concepts to diverse audiences, thereby facilitating mutual understanding and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural innovator, you enjoy exploring uncharted territories, taking risks, and seizing opportunities to disrupt markets with new, compelling product adventures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate a customer-first mindset, continuously advocating for the end-user and striving to enhance customer engagement, satisfaction, and loyalty through groundbreaking tech solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An advanced degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, Engineering, or an MBA is advantageous, reflecting a sophisticated grasp of business and technology integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with global teams and managing products in international markets will be beneficial, offering a broader perspective on diverse customer needs and market dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a startup or rapidly scaling tech company is valued, granting agility and insight into navigating high-growth environments effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of successful product launches in a highly competitive landscape will further differentiate candidates, showcasing an ability to manage complexity and deliver impactful results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of experience working with large Enterprise customers, understanding their needs around scale, data governance, and data reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Product, Channel Infrastructure and Mobile is essential to Klaviyo&#39;s goal of leading in personalized customer experiences. As businesses grow, they require the scalable and flexible communication platforms this role oversees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tasked with enhancing omnichannel messaging, the director empowers customers to maximize their preferred channels, driving engagement and substantive growth. This position highlights technology&#39;s power to forge deeper relationships and expand businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will lead Klaviyo&#39;s product development during this high-growth phase, impacting how global brands interact with millions of consumers. This role offers a unique opportunity for professional impact at the forefront of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$224,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$336,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
