&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Workplace Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Klaviyo, we’re Built Different: a company of builders who take ownership, operate with candor, and believe we’re 1% done. That mindset extends to how we think about our workplaces. They’re not spaces to manage; they’re experiences to design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Manager, Workplace Experience to lead Workplace Experience operations across Klaviyo’s international office portfolio, including Dublin, London, Paris, Munich, Sydney, and Singapore, while helping scale future EMEA and APAC evolution efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Dublin, this role will oversee a distributed Workplace Experience team supporting office operations, employee experience, workplace programs, and regional expansion initiatives across multiple countries and time zones. This leader will partner closely with the Head of Communications, Workplace &amp;amp; Experiences, the US Workplace Experience Manager, and Real Estate leadership to help shape and scale Klaviyo’s global workplace strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an experienced people leader who combines operational excellence with a genuine passion for creating environments where people thrive. You think in systems, lead with empathy, and hold a high bar for your team, vendors, and workplace experience. You’re energized by building scalable programs, navigating ambiguity, and creating workplaces that help teams do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, hire, coach, and develop the international Workplace Experience team supporting Klaviyo offices across EMEA and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Workplace Experience operations across Klaviyo’s international office portfolio, balancing consistency, scalability, and local market needs across multiple countries, vendors, and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on the evolution of Klaviyo’s global workplace experience strategy while driving operational excellence across the international office portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the on-the-ground Workplace Experience partner for the continued evolution of Klaviyo’s Dublin headquarters, supporting buildout execution, employee readiness, workplace operations, and change management efforts in partnership with Real Estate and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support EMEA and APAC expansion initiatives, including evaluating new office locations, standing up operational processes, managing vendors and facilities partners, and helping launch new workplaces that reflect Klaviyo’s culture and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic partner to Workplace Experience leadership and cross-functional stakeholders, translating employee feedback, utilization data, and operational insights into recommendations that shape workplace investment, office design, and programming decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of continuous improvement by identifying operational gaps, diagnosing root causes, and implementing scalable solutions across offices and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Employee Experience and Internal Communications teams to support thoughtful, high-quality in-office programming, cultural initiatives, and employee events across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead vendor management across the international portfolio, including sourcing, contract negotiation, performance management, and strategic vendor partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on workplace planning and space utilization strategy using tools like OfficeSpace, leveraging data and employee feedback to inform workplace decisions and future growth planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive workplace technology improvements in partnership with Global IT, evaluating tools and systems that improve the employee experience across conference rooms, desk booking, digital signage, visitor management, and office operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve workplace policies, procedures, and safety standards to ensure consistency, scalability, and local compliance across EMEA and APAC offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with New Hire Success and local office teams to deliver a thoughtful and consistent onboarding experience for employees joining across international offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish operational standards and accountability mechanisms that ensure every Klaviyo office reflects the quality of our brand and employee experience expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee workplace operations across office services, supplies, food &amp;amp; beverage, and employee amenities with a focus on quality, efficiency, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, cross-functional workplace projects including office launches, moves, reconfigurations, and operational improvement initiatives across multiple regions and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a thoughtful, high-quality visitor and employee experience that reflects Klaviyo’s culture across every office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of the Workplace Experience function as the company continues to scale internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–10+ years of progressive experience in workplace experience, office operations, hospitality, facilities management, or related operational leadership roles, including experience managing and developing teams in fast-growing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced people leader who builds high-performing teams through clear expectations, coaching, accountability, and strong operational partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who operates comfortably at both the strategic and tactical level. You can zoom out to improve long-term operating models while staying close to day-to-day workplace execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational expertise across workplace management, vendor operations, office launches, workplace technology, employee experience programming, and regional office management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating across multiple offices, countries, or regions with an understanding of how to balance global consistency with local market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator who builds trust and collaborates effectively across leadership teams, vendors, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project and program management instincts with the ability to manage competing priorities, navigate ambiguity, and drive execution across multiple stakeholders and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with GSuite and Slack required. Experience with workplace management platforms such as OfficeSpace, Freshworks, or similar tools strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating with high autonomy in a fast-growing environment while balancing strategic thinking with hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outgoing, personable, and polished, with a hospitality-minded approach to workplace experience and team leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a highly collaborative, primarily onsite role based in Dublin, with flexibility required to support workplace programming, office operations, and coordination across international time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift 20+ lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labour in the country where the job post is advertised. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE&amp;nbsp; range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range in Local Currency:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€72.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
