&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Commercial Partner Account Manager, Asia&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives each Klaviyo brings to our workplace every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo’s Partnerships team helps drive durable growth through our ecosystem of agency, systems integrator, consultant, and technology partners. We work closely with partners to create demand, unlock new revenue, improve customer outcomes, and bring the full value of Klaviyo to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our best Partner Managers are commercial, partner-first, and highly collaborative. They know how to turn strong relationships into measurable business outcomes through joint go-to-market planning, co-sell execution, and partner enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Commercial Partner Account Manager, Asia, you will build Klaviyo’s Commercial partner pipeline across Asia by recruiting, onboarding, and activating high-potential new partners. This is a high-build, execution-first role with a clear mandate: grow the partner engine in Asia and turn that partner momentum into pipeline, co-sell activity, and revenue impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on identifying and winning the right agency, services, and technology partners across Asia, prioritizing partners that meet Klaviyo’s ideal partner profile, help them build a stronger Klaviyo practice, and create repeatable motions that generate qualified demand across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with strong business development instincts who can open doors, build credibility quickly, and move fluidly between partner recruitment, GTM planning, co-sell execution, and field collaboration. We are looking for someone who operates with a high degree of autonomy: someone who can develop a clear point of view on which partners to prioritize, lead value conversations independently, and proactively bring together the right internal and external stakeholders to move opportunities forward. You should be excited by building from the ground up, comfortable working across diverse Asia markets, and motivated by revenue outcomes rather than partner activity alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you’ll make an impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard, and activate high-potential new Commercial partners across Asia, with a focus on agencies and ecosystem players that meet Klaviyo’s ideal partner profile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a repeatable Asia partner recruitment engine that expands Klaviyo’s regional coverage and creates durable partner-sourced pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline through structured joint GTM plans, partner business plans, and co-sell execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationships with partner executives, sales leaders, and delivery teams to accelerate activation and long-term value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Klaviyo Sales on account planning, opportunity creation, and deal acceleration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partners strengthen their Klaviyo positioning, service offerings, and commercial motion so they can grow their practice profitably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Partner Marketing and cross-functional counterparts to launch programs that generate awareness, demand, and qualified pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and commercial judgment to prioritize the right partners, inspect progress, and improve conversion, velocity, and output over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an evidence-backed point of view on where Klaviyo should place its bets across markets, partner types, and growth plays in Asia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently lead account mapping, joint business planning, and structured partner planning sessions that translate into measurable pipeline and revenue outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel as needed to meet with partners, support field engagement, and represent Klaviyo at key events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong shortlist and steady stream of high-potential new partners entering the funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newly recruited partners activated into real co-sell and pipeline generation motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear progress building a partner growth engine in Asia around high-fit partners that match the ideal partner profile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy partner-sourced pipeline creation, with a focus on quality, velocity, and conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional alignment with Sales, Partner Marketing, and regional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted judgment on partner prioritization, forecasting, and opportunity quality, with clear visibility into risks, upside, and next actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners and internal stakeholders view you as a credible, proactive operator who can move complex opportunities forward without heavy manager involvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in partnerships, channel, business development, sales, account management, or a related SaaS go-to-market role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of recruiting, building, or growing partners that generate measurable pipeline or revenue outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts and a bias for action; you know how to turn activity into real business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with agency, services, consulting, and/or technology partners in growth-stage or scaled SaaS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how agency and technology partners build profitable go-to-market motions and create commercial value with SaaS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandarin language capability is strongly preferred given the role’s market coverage and partner opportunity across Asia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Greater China Region also preferred but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working directly with sales teams on account planning, co-sell motions, and opportunity progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trust quickly with external partners and internal stakeholders across multiple markets and functions, from practitioners through executive leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity, setting priorities independently, and building structure where little exists today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator with strong executive presence and the ability to lead value-based business conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to articulate Klaviyo’s product differentiation in a way that connects platform capability to partner revenue outcomes and client value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operator with sound forecasting discipline, CRM hygiene, and the ability to use data to self-diagnose gaps, risks, and whitespace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI fluent and comfortable using AI responsibly to improve productivity, sharpen thinking, and model modern ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, accountable, and solutions-oriented; you take ownership of outcomes, surface issues early, and improve how the work gets done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this role is compelling&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Asia is a high-upside growth opportunity for Klaviyo, and this role sits at the center of how we expand our partner-led motion in the region. You’ll have the opportunity to build in-market momentum, shape how we win with partners, and play a visible role in scaling one of the most important growth engines in APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited by building, commercial problem-solving, and creating partner momentum from zero to one, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Klaviyo in APAC:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are rapidly expanding our footprint in Asia-Pacific with our new Singapore Hub. Since launching here just six months ago we are already scaling fast, aggressively building out our core GTM functions, including Sales, Pre-sales, Business Development, Customer Success, Partnerships, Marketing, and People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true &lt;strong&gt;“1% done”&lt;/strong&gt; moment. While we build on the strong foundation of our Sydney presence, our Singapore Hub offers the unique energy of a startup within a global company. We are looking for &lt;strong&gt;“Drivers”&lt;/strong&gt;—builders who want to shape our local culture and define the future of Klaviyo in Asia-Pacific and Japan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aligned with our value of &lt;strong&gt;Always Learning&lt;/strong&gt;, we are looking for the leaders of the future. The headroom for growth here is massive. If you are insatiably curious and eager to accelerate your career, Klaviyo provides the platform. Join us, and help build something exceptional from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Covey as part of our hiring and / or promotional process. For jobs or candidates in NYC, certain features may qualify it as an AEDT. As part of the evaluation process we provide Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; on April 3, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see the independent bias audit report covering our use of Covey &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot; href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI- Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
