&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Manager, Recruiting Operations and play an instrumental role in helping our RecOcs team scale globally. In this role, you&#39;ll drive the show - partnering closely with recruiters, interviewers, hiring managers, recruiting leadership, &amp;amp; cross-functional stakeholders to raise the bar on how we hire. You&#39;ll own the details of coordination, sharpen our processes, and build the systems that let us hire efficiently at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make a difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own scheduling and coordinating both virtual and onsite interviews using Guide and Greenhouse, from initial availability requests through candidate confirmation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure an exceptional candidate experience through prompt follow-up, high-quality coordination of all aspects of the interview cycle, &amp;amp; clear, personalized communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate onsite interview logistics, candidate travel, and reimbursements across Klaviyo’s global locations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal interview processes promptly, accurately, and with confidentiality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic partner on recruiting ops challenges - spotting scalable solutions through data, tools, process improvements, and cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive high-leverage TA programs and enablement, including automated workflows interviewer training, and candidate NPS initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in recruiting coordination, operations, or with related experience in fast-paced, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management &amp;amp; communication skills with a customer first mentality — you build rapport and earn trust fast, no matter who you&#39;re working with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of improving workflows, operational processes, or systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent with tools like Guide, Greenhouse, Slack, Navan, and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, with sharp prioritization instincts and the ability to move fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, proactive, and solutions-first when tackling operational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and genuine drive to make processes, documentation, and team operations better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &quot;no task too big or too small&quot; attitude, with the professionalism &amp;amp; discretion to support candidates at any level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Please note that this is a contract position based in our Boston office; this is an hourly role and will be paid through an external partner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
