&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Please note that this is a contract position based in our Boston office; this is an hourly role and will be paid through an external partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Talent Acquisition Professional to join our recruiting team as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt; in our Boston HQ. As part of the Talent Acquisition team, you will have the opportunity to build strong relationships with leaders across the organization, with a particular focus on supporting our &lt;strong&gt;Customer Support and Customer Success teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a direct impact on Klaviyo’s continued growth, helping shape our culture and business through the talented, driven, and empathetic people you bring into the company. You’ll take ownership of the recruiting process and your results, using data and insights to make our hiring more effective and efficient while maintaining an outstanding candidate experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Recruiter, you will act as a trusted talent partner to our &lt;strong&gt;Customer Support and Customer Success organizations&lt;/strong&gt;, helping us attract and hire exceptional talent as these teams continue to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you&#39;ll make a difference:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Your Process:&lt;/strong&gt; From sourcing passive candidates to closing offers, you will own the full recruiting lifecycle and provide every candidate with an exceptional experience. You’ll ensure Klaviyo is engaging with and hiring exceptional people who can help take our Customer Support and Customer Success organizations to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve Our Process:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re not perfect, but we do like to recognize and improve those imperfections. Every Klaviyo has a voice, and we want to hear yours! Fresh perspectives grounded in data and analytics are encouraged as we continuously improve how we hire. This includes leveraging AI tools to streamline recruiting workflows, improve productivity, and enhance decision-making across sourcing, interviewing, and candidate communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Your empathy and people-centric approach will help you build lasting relationships with candidates and hiring managers. You’ll develop a deep understanding of the teams you support and act as a trusted advisor on talent strategy, market insights, and hiring decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an Ambassador:&lt;/strong&gt; Whether through Klaviyo’s social media channels, recruiting events, or good old-fashioned cold outreach, you are an ambassador for Klaviyo and, in many cases, the first impression a candidate will have of the company. Candidates are people, and you’ll take a balanced approach that makes each candidate feel like an individual while keeping Klaviyo’s business objectives in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level Up:&lt;/strong&gt; Learning and growth is a core value at Klaviyo. We want every employee who joins to learn new skills, take on new challenges, and achieve things that significantly advance their career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of experience in full-cycle recruiting, ideally supporting &lt;strong&gt;Customer Success, Customer Support, or other customer-facing organizations&lt;/strong&gt; in a high-growth or scaling environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experienced partnering with senior leaders and hiring managers to understand business needs and translate them into effective talent strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deeply people-centric, empathetic, and relationship-driven&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-informed and results-oriented, with a strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Energized by challenge and motivated by continuous personal and professional growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to balance an exceptional candidate experience with ambitious hiring goals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An early adopter of AI who continuously explores new tools and workflows to improve your effectiveness as a recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$90 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
